{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.191.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d335e060d57b9f1d47728a89f4d55d5c","RawContent":"@NixSpade \n\nHere&#039;s the info I have on Azul Negril: \n\n2015 Packages\n[url=\"http:\/\/memorablemomentsweddings.com\/Karisma-Wedding-Planning-resources.cfm?agencyID=0&amp;amp;RD=0&amp;amp;LT=0\"]http:\/\/memorablemomentsweddings.com\/Karisma-Wedding-Planning-resources.cfm?agencyID=0&amp;amp;RD=0&amp;amp;LT=0[\/url]\n\n2016 and on\n[url=\"http:\/\/memorablemomentsweddings.com\/Karisma-MM-home.cfm?agencyID=0&amp;amp;RD=0&amp;amp;LT=0\"]http:\/\/memorablemomentsweddings.com\/Karisma-MM-home.cfm?agencyID=0&amp;amp;RD=0&amp;amp;LT=0[\/url]\nI think you can reach the central weddings department at 1.866.527.4762 for the latest info. Tell them your location and hopefully they can direct you to someone who can arrange a quote for the Negril location. If you are absolutely set on Negril as your location and planning for next October, I say don&#039;t hesitate; go for it!! Let me know how it goes!! Good luck :) \n\n[quote name=\"NixSpade\" post=\"1914323\" timestamp=\"1465677171\"]\nFollowing because I LOVE Negril and want the sensatori location but I haven&#039;t found any reviews and all the packages I&#039;ve been looking at say that they don&#039;t apply to Jamaica. Help!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1914355,"PostDate":1465835942,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@NixSpade\u00a0<br><br>\nHere's the info I have on Azul Negril:\u00a0<br><br>\n2015 Packages<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/memorablemomentsweddings.com\/Karisma-Wedding-Planning-resources.cfm?agencyID=0&RD=0&LT=0' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/memorablemome...yID=0&RD=0&LT=0<\/a><br><br>\n2016 and on<br>\n<a href='http:\/\/memorablemomentsweddings.com\/Karisma-MM-home.cfm?agencyID=0&RD=0&LT=0' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/memorablemome...yID=0&RD=0&LT=0<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\nI think you can reach the central weddings department at\u00a01.866.527.4762 for the latest info. Tell them your location and hopefully they can direct you to someone who can arrange a quote for the Negril location. If you are absolutely set on Negril as your location and planning for next October, I say don't hesitate;\u00a0go for it!! Let me know how it goes!! Good luck <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>NixSpade, on 11 June 2016 - 01:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Following because I LOVE Negril and want the sensatori location but I haven't found any reviews and all the packages I've been looking at say that they don't apply to Jamaica. Help!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theharriswedding2017@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.191.200.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465340853,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287094.jpg?_r=1465831329","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2Be2017","Id":287094,"Name":"Bride2Be2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.212.143.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e8b366f863198703eafb83ade9b48f3","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"Bride2Be2017\"],\n\nI was in the same boat as you trying to choose which part of the isalnd to have my wedding.\n\nUltimately what I found was that, Negril is too far from all the main attractions. One of my friends just stayed in Negril  and even though she liked Rics Cafe and the 7 mile beach, her and her hubby disliked that they couldn&#039;t explore the other side of the island. It would have been 6 am mornings for them to travel into Montego Bay or a full day to Ohco Rios.\n\nBeing a local myself, I don&#039;t find that there is much to do in Negril. I love Montego Bay and Ohco for the night life and attractions. We ended up choosing Runaway Bay, becauce it is quite and my guest can travel easily to Montego Bay or Ohco. We are staying at the Grand Bahia and having the wedding next door at Laughing Waters.\n\nThe hotel charges too much for guest not staying on resort to attend the wedding. Most of the guest are from Jamaica. We are expecting to have over 100 guests.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions about the Island.\n\n[quote name=\"Bride2Be2017\" post=\"1914277\" timestamp=\"1465426010\"]\nHi Sweetpea2018 and 2017weddingguy, \n\nI&#039;m currently researching venues in Jamaica and took an exploratory trip there last month. We didnt have Azul Sentatori on our final list but at the suggestion of a chef at our hotel in Runaway Bay, we made the trip. No appointment, no tour requested, no guarantee they would even let us past the gate. Thankfully, when we arrived we were able to get an abridged impromptu wedding site inspection tour. The immediate curb appeal of the hotel driving up to the gate, leaves much to be desired, but once we got into the front lobby, we were absolutely blown away!! We even got a glimpse of wedding that was being set up, and it looked really beautiful. The setting couldn&#039;t have been more serene. If you are planning on having 20+ guests I HIGHLY suggest you contact the wedding team. After a peek at the wedding we (me, my fiance and parents) were invited invited to the wedding department, where they showed us pictures of other weddings, let us look through books of sample menus, flower arrangements, entertainment, everything.\nWe toured the entire northern coast of Jamaica during our visit, none of the sunsets on the island can beat what we saw in Negril. The only drawback for me is that Negril is far away from some of some of Jamaica&#039;s biggest attractions that I want my family and friends to experience during their trip (Dunn&#039;s River, Bamboo Rafting, Bobsledding, Blue Hole). But I just may have to get over it. After all, Negril has the 7-mile beach! I&#039;m still torn as to which location to choose - Negril or Runaway Bay. I included a picture of the wedding set-up we saw. It was a sunset wedding and it had just rained. The picture doesn&#039;t really do it justice, because even as a passerby the wedding not only looked beautiful but FELT beautiful; and isn&#039;t that what you want on your wedding day? I hope you can see why I&#039;m so torn. We are hoping to get married next summer. Need to decide soon - eek!\n\nBelow are some pics of our speedy but wonderful tour at Azul Sensatori in early May 2016. \n[url=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/folderview?id=0BxyrmFa8BxWQSC1iMzZqYXZZNEE&amp;amp;usp=sharing\"]Azul Sensatori Jamaica - May 2016 Site Inspection Tour[\/url]\n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1914373,"PostDate":1465858718,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287094\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287094-bride2be2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bride2Be2017<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was in the same boat as you trying to choose which part of the isalnd to have my wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ultimately what I found was that, Negril is too far from all the main attractions. One of my friends just stayed in Negril\u00a0 and even though she liked Rics Cafe and the 7 mile beach, her and her hubby disliked that they couldn't explore the other side of the island. It would have been 6 am mornings for them to travel into Montego Bay or a full day to Ohco Rios.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Being a local myself, I don't find that there is much to do in Negril. I love Montego Bay and Ohco for the night life and attractions. We ended up choosing Runaway Bay, becauce it is quite and my guest can travel easily to Montego Bay or Ohco. We are staying at the Grand Bahia and having the wedding next door at Laughing Waters.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The hotel charges too much for guest not staying on resort to attend the wedding. Most of the guest are from Jamaica. We are expecting to have over 100 guests.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know if you have any questions about the Island.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bride2Be2017, on 08 June 2016 - 03:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi\u00a0Sweetpea2018 and 2017weddingguy,\u00a0<br><br>\nI'm currently researching venues in Jamaica and took an exploratory trip there last month. We didnt have Azul Sentatori on our final list but at the suggestion of a chef at our hotel in Runaway Bay, we made the trip. No appointment, no tour requested, no guarantee they would even let us past the gate. Thankfully, when we arrived we were able to get an abridged impromptu wedding site inspection tour. The immediate curb appeal of the hotel driving up to the gate, leaves much to be desired, but once we got into the front lobby, we were absolutely blown away!! We even got a glimpse of wedding that was being set up, and it looked really beautiful. The setting couldn't have been more serene. If you are planning on having 20+ guests I HIGHLY suggest you contact the wedding team. After a peek at the wedding we (me, my fiance and parents) were invited invited to the wedding department, where they showed us pictures of other weddings, let us look through books of sample menus, flower arrangements, entertainment, everything.<br>\nWe toured the entire northern coast of Jamaica during our visit, none of the sunsets on the island can beat what we saw in Negril. The only drawback for me is that Negril is far away from some of some of Jamaica's biggest attractions that I want my family and friends to experience during their trip (Dunn's River, Bamboo Rafting, Bobsledding, Blue Hole). But I just may have to get over it. After all, Negril has the 7-mile beach! I'm still torn as to which location to choose - Negril or Runaway Bay. I included a picture of the wedding set-up we saw. It was a sunset wedding and it had just rained. The picture doesn't really do it justice, because even as a passerby the wedding not only looked beautiful but FELT beautiful; and isn't that what you want on your wedding day? I hope you can see why I'm so torn.\u00a0We are hoping to get married next summer. Need to decide soon - eek!<br><br>\nBelow are some pics of our speedy but wonderful tour at Azul Sensatori in early May 2016.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/drive.google.com\/folderview?id=0BxyrmFa8BxWQSC1iMzZqYXZZNEE&usp=sharing' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Azul Sensatori Jamaica - May 2016 Site Inspection Tour<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shack_era@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"173.212.143.91","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465857726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MrsSLMP","Id":287154,"Name":"MrsSLMP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.191.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d1b3ceeab106015877a03f18fd6660e","RawContent":"@MrsSLMP \nThank you so much for commenting!!! I have been trying to find other \"Runaway\" brides on the forum who are not having their actual wedding at an AI. When I stayed at the Grand Bahia I was totally satisfied. It&#039;s definitely still my top choice hotel to recommend to my guests, and also location. I was just researching Laughing Waters today. We are also expecting about 100 guests. I would LOVE to chat more. Have you decided on a date yet? I have so many questions - I hope you dont mind. Sending you a message now. \n [quote name=\"MrsSLMP\" post=\"1914373\" timestamp=\"1465855118\"]\nHi @[member=\"Bride2Be2017\"],\n\nI was in the same boat as you trying to choose which part of the isalnd to have my wedding.\n\nUltimately what I found was that, Negril is too far from all the main attractions. One of my friends just stayed in Negril  and even though she liked Rics Cafe and the 7 mile beach, her and her hubby disliked that they couldn&#039;t explore the other side of the island. It would have been 6 am mornings for them to travel into Montego Bay or a full day to Ohco Rios.\n\nBeing a local myself, I don&#039;t find that there is much to do in Negril. I love Montego Bay and Ohco for the night life and attractions. We ended up choosing Runaway Bay, becauce it is quite and my guest can travel easily to Montego Bay or Ohco. We are staying at the Grand Bahia and having the wedding next door at Laughing Waters.\n\nThe hotel charges too much for guest not staying on resort to attend the wedding. Most of the guest are from Jamaica. We are expecting to have over 100 guests.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions about the Island.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1914375,"PostDate":1465866657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@MrsSLMP\u00a0<br>\nThank you so much for commenting!!! I have been trying to find other \"Runaway\" brides on the forum who are not having their actual wedding at an AI. When I stayed at the Grand Bahia I was totally satisfied. It's definitely still my top choice hotel to recommend to my guests, and also location. I was just researching Laughing Waters today. We are also expecting about 100 guests. I would LOVE to chat more. Have you decided on a date yet? I have so many questions - I hope you dont mind. Sending you a message now.\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MrsSLMP, on 13 June 2016 - 02:58 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287094\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287094-bride2be2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bride2Be2017<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was in the same boat as you trying to choose which part of the isalnd to have my wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ultimately what I found was that, Negril is too far from all the main attractions. One of my friends just stayed in Negril\u00a0 and even though she liked Rics Cafe and the 7 mile beach, her and her hubby disliked that they couldn't explore the other side of the island. It would have been 6 am mornings for them to travel into Montego Bay or a full day to Ohco Rios.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Being a local myself, I don't find that there is much to do in Negril. I love Montego Bay and Ohco for the night life and attractions. We ended up choosing Runaway Bay, becauce it is quite and my guest can travel easily to Montego Bay or Ohco. We are staying at the Grand Bahia and having the wedding next door at Laughing Waters.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The hotel charges too much for guest not staying on resort to attend the wedding. Most of the guest are from Jamaica. We are expecting to have over 100 guests.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know if you have any questions about the Island.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theharriswedding2017@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.191.200.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465340853,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287094.jpg?_r=1465831329","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2Be2017","Id":287094,"Name":"Bride2Be2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.150.154.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7aff04a050026a94ae3f1110690d7c7a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bride2Be2017\" post=\"1914289\" timestamp=\"1465487752\"]\n@[member=\"JasminMattPhoto\"] That would be GREAT! I would love to see some photos of your trip to Runaway Bay. Please do keep me posted when you get back! \n\nI really love the Runaway Bay area, I think it&#039;s the all around best location to stay on the island for a vacation. I&#039;m pretty decided that most of our guests will stay at Grand Bahia but I wasn&#039;t thrilled with their actual wedding locations - at least 3 weddings a day like clockwork. I loved my stay as a guest there but dont think the location would make me a happy bride. Now considering booking a villa for the wedding day and bus ppl there. Please let me know if you see any place interesting that I missed have missed if you explore! \n\n \n\n@[member=\"sjlova86\"]  I am based in NYC[\/quote]\n@[member=\"Bride2Be2017\"] We are back from our trip. It was a great time and where we stayed at the Grand Bahia was absolutely beautiful. I&#039;ll attach a bunch of photos from our resort and once we have some teasers from the wedding at Jewel Runaway Bay I can attach those as well for you &amp;lt;3\n\nThis is an outdoor reception space for weddings and events. Right by the water so you can stay nice and cool on those warm Jamaican nights.\nGreat view for a romantic moment and a perfect backdrop for photos\nWhere your wedding ceremony could be held\nLots of green space for newlywed photos\nAnother great backdrop for photos\n\nCheck out more of the attached photos to see more of the resort :)","Attachments":[{"Id":36067,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_002.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-02354400-1466784110.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-02354400-1466784110_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36069,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_004.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-45417600-1466784155.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-45417600-1466784155_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36070,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_005.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-26546600-1466784178.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-26546600-1466784178_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36071,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_006.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-29331800-1466784200.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-29331800-1466784200_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36072,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_007.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-26479800-1466784233.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-26479800-1466784233_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36073,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_008.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-16683800-1466784265.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-16683800-1466784265_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36074,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_009.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-38770000-1466784292.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-38770000-1466784292_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36075,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_010.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-10612700-1466784317.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-10612700-1466784317_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36076,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_011.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-30289400-1466784547.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-30289400-1466784547_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36077,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_012.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-77282300-1466784573.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-77282300-1466784573_thumb.jpg","Width":802,"Height":1200},{"Id":36079,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_014.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-34253000-1466784635.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-34253000-1466784635_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36080,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_015.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-42237500-1466784660.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-42237500-1466784660_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36082,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_017.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-06528200-1466784704.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-06528200-1466784704_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36083,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_018.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-21457800-1466784726.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-21457800-1466784726_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36084,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_019.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-82289800-1466784751.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-82289800-1466784751_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36086,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_021.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-30781400-1466784931.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-30781400-1466784931_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36087,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_022.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-59771200-1466784953.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-59771200-1466784953_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36088,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_023.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-65941700-1466785018.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-65941700-1466785018_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36089,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_024.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-70831700-1466785038.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-70831700-1466785038_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36090,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_025.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-74933200-1466785059.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-74933200-1466785059_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36091,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_026.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-49564200-1466785083.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-49564200-1466785083_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36092,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_027.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-07252300-1466785108.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-07252300-1466785108_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36093,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_028.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-21362400-1466785131.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-21362400-1466785131_thumb.jpg","Width":802,"Height":1200},{"Id":36094,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_029.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-46158500-1466785161.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-46158500-1466785161_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36095,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_030.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-49279100-1466785182.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-49279100-1466785182_thumb.jpg","Width":802,"Height":1200},{"Id":36096,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_031.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-14803800-1466785205.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-14803800-1466785205_thumb.jpg","Width":802,"Height":1200},{"Id":36097,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_032.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-48651600-1466785227.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-48651600-1466785227_thumb.jpg","Width":802,"Height":1200}],"Id":1914547,"PostDate":1466788833,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bride2Be2017, on 09 June 2016 - 08:55 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287055-jasminmattphoto\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JasminMattPhoto<\/span><\/a> That would be GREAT! I would love to see some photos of your trip to Runaway Bay. Please do keep me posted when you get back!\u00a0<br><br>\nI really love the Runaway Bay area, I think it's the all around best location to stay on the island for a vacation. I'm pretty decided that most of our guests will stay at Grand Bahia but I wasn't thrilled with their actual wedding locations - at least 3 weddings a day like clockwork. I loved my stay as a guest there but dont think the location would make me a happy bride. Now considering booking a villa for the wedding day and bus ppl there. Please let me know if you see any place interesting that I missed have missed if you explore!\u00a0<br><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287064\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287064-sjlova86\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sjlova86<\/span><\/a> \u00a0I am based in NYC\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287094\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287094-bride2be2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bride2Be2017<\/span><\/a> We are back from our trip. It was a great time and where we stayed at the Grand Bahia was absolutely beautiful. I'll attach a bunch of photos from our resort and once we have some teasers from the wedding at Jewel Runaway Bay I can attach those as well for you <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914547]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-12966600-1466784087.jpg\" title=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_001.jpg -  66.69KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-12966600-1466784087.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_001.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>This is an outdoor reception space for weddings and events. Right by the water so you can stay nice and cool on those warm Jamaican nights.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914547]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-50016600-1466784132.jpg\" title=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_003.jpg -  105.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-50016600-1466784132.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_003.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Great view for a romantic moment and a perfect backdrop for photos<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914547]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-24095900-1466784600.jpg\" title=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_013.jpg -  119.41KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-24095900-1466784600.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_013.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Where your wedding ceremony could be held<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914547]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-12488300-1466784782.jpg\" title=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_020.jpg -  158.07KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-12488300-1466784782.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_020.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Lots of green space for newlywed photos<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914547]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-93338800-1466784682.jpg\" title=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_016.jpg -  96.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-93338800-1466784682.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_016.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Another great backdrop for photos<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Check out more of the attached photos to see more of the resort <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>Read our testimonials of appreciation from previous couples<\/a>\u00a0<3<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Rated 5 out of 5 stars on Facebook. <strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Check us out!<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464799539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.191.199.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80067,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"393afed580a6b0766aa4d728f06b3c86","RawContent":"@ JasminMattPhoto \n\nThanks so much for sharing these pictures of GBP! You really captured wonderful vantage points. In our tour of GBP, it was hard to get a sense of what areas were actually available for booking. There was once place much like your first picture that they said wasnt available for weddings - outdoor dining for the Rodozio only. Anyways, your pictures are absolutely stunning! We actually ended up deciding on a place, but i&#039;ll definitely keep an eye out for any photos you might post for the wedding at Jewel!! &amp;lt;3 \n[quote name=\"JasminMattPhoto\" post=\"1914547\" timestamp=\"1466785233\"]\n@[member=\"Bride2Be2017\"] We are back from our trip. It was a great time and where we stayed at the Grand Bahia was absolutely beautiful. I&#039;ll attach a bunch of photos from our resort and once we have some teasers from the wedding at Jewel Runaway Bay I can attach those as well for you &amp;lt;3\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=36066\"]Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_001.jpg[\/url]\nThis is an outdoor reception space for weddings and events. Right by the water so you can stay nice and cool on those warm Jamaican nights.\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=36068\"]Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_003.jpg[\/url]\nGreat view for a romantic moment and a perfect backdrop for photos\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=36078\"]Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_013.jpg[\/url]\nWhere your wedding ceremony could be held\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=36085\"]Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_020.jpg[\/url]\nLots of green space for newlywed photos\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=36081\"]Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_016.jpg[\/url]\nAnother great backdrop for photos\n\nCheck out more of the attached photos to see more of the resort :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1914691,"PostDate":1467766852,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@ JasminMattPhoto\u00a0<br><br>\nThanks so much for sharing these pictures of GBP! You really captured wonderful vantage points. In our tour of GBP, it was hard to get a sense of what areas were actually available for booking. There was once place much like your first picture that they said wasnt available for weddings - outdoor dining for the Rodozio only. Anyways, your pictures are absolutely stunning! We actually ended up deciding on a place, but i'll definitely keep an eye out for any photos you might post for the wedding at Jewel!! <3\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JasminMattPhoto, on 24 June 2016 - 09:20 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287094\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287094-bride2be2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bride2Be2017<\/span><\/a> We are back from our trip. It was a great time and where we stayed at the Grand Bahia was absolutely beautiful. I'll attach a bunch of photos from our resort and once we have some teasers from the wedding at Jewel Runaway Bay I can attach those as well for you <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=36066' class='bbc_url' title=''>Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_001.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>This is an outdoor reception space for weddings and events. Right by the water so you can stay nice and cool on those warm Jamaican nights.<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=36068' class='bbc_url' title=''>Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_003.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Great view for a romantic moment and a perfect backdrop for photos<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=36078' class='bbc_url' title=''>Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_013.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Where your wedding ceremony could be held<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=36085' class='bbc_url' title=''>Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_020.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Lots of green space for newlywed photos<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=36081' class='bbc_url' title=''>Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_016.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Another great backdrop for photos<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Check out more of the attached photos to see more of the resort <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theharriswedding2017@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.191.200.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465340853,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287094.jpg?_r=1465831329","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2Be2017","Id":287094,"Name":"Bride2Be2017","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
