t-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married at the Iberostar Grand Rose Hall, what exactly do you want to know? I have so much information!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dzamechansky@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.109.118.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439232775,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dzamech","Id":284352,"Name":"dzamech","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.224.130.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9caeefd3771f4b659873060d9ab4f4f4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Awesome!!!!!! I just wanted to see what things they look for on the final details list they send. When I emailed the WC they said they will not be contacting us until May and I&#039;m so anxious to start the list! Lol! When are you getting married?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909983,"PostDate":1453683568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Awesome!!!!!! I just wanted to see what things they look for on the final details list they send. When I emailed the WC they said they will not be contacting us until May and I'm so anxious to start the list! Lol! When are you getting married?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malcolmandpatricka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.0.130.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453311548,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsThorpe","Id":285969,"Name":"FutureMrsThorpe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.37.215.64","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79887,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by dzamech, 28 January 2016 - 02:41 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1454020895,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f20d8edce503caa93c2208600e902a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have SSOOOO much info!! you can find me on facebook and PM me Danielle Zamechansky (I&#039;m the only one lol) and also there is a facebook group called Iberostar RoseHall-Sisterhood of the Traveling Starfish! It is filled with brides who have and are having their wedding there tons of pictures and information and you can ask any question!! When is your wedding? We&#039;re getting married May 29!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910180,"PostDate":1454020873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%