> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=79887&start=10&SessionId=7aa655965e7eec9e7b75b3d8db6d1278
> User NicoleVal (287382)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.148.43.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b3eb5a056085ea5acd5f8fb74cc1349","RawContent":"Hello brides! I&#039;m getting married in 2017. Still trying to finalize a resort, I&#039;m seriously considering Iberostar but would love some more info! Is the reception included in the package a private reception? If not, does anyone know how much extra it is for a private reception and how much it would be to extend the reception as well? Thank you!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1912280,"PostDate":1459211086,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello brides! I'm getting married in 2017. Still trying to finalize a resort, I'm seriously considering Iberostar but would love some more info! Is the reception included in the package a private reception? If not, does anyone know how much extra it is for a private reception and how much it would be to extend the reception as well? Thank you!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"harpreet_binning@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.3.78.183","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452984097,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hbinning","Id":285920,"Name":"Hbinning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.46.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7156bdc38db57627ba7def6933dc988","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"Hbinning\"] - I got married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suites June 2015 and I can partially answer your question. The included reception is semi-private, not private. There are quite a few options to make part or all of the night private. A lot of brides use the included semi-private dinner and then do a private bonfire on the beach with a DJ and bar after dinner. Or you can rent the disco for private use from 9-11.\n\nYou can rent a restaurant to have a completely private reception, which is what we did for our 73 guests. You have to have a minimum of 40 guests for restaurant rental. I think they have changed the pricing slightly from last year, but we paid a flat $800 for the rental of the restaurant which included the meal, beer and wine. We added the full bar per person per hour. The reception ended at 10pm. I did ask how much it would cost to extend it an hour, which I think was only a $200 fee for the staff, but when you add in the extra $190 per hour for the DJ and another hour of bar for everyone, it got to be a REALLY expensive hour!\n\nYou could also do the whole thing dinner and dancing on the beach, but if you have dinner on the beach they require you to rent a tent and that increases your costs pretty substantially.\n\nHope that helps a little!\n[quote name=\"Hbinning\" post=\"1912280\" timestamp=\"1459207486\"]\nHello brides! I&#039;m getting married in 2017. Still trying to finalize a resort, I&#039;m seriously considering Iberostar but would love some more info! Is the reception included in the package a private reception? If not, does anyone know how much extra it is for a private reception and how much it would be to extend the reception as well? Thank you!! :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1912714,"PostDate":1460142051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285920\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/285920-hbinning\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Hbinning<\/span><\/a> - I got married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suites June 2015 and I can partially answer your question. The included reception is semi-private, not private. There are quite a few options to make part or all of the night private. A lot of brides use the included semi-private dinner and then do a private bonfire on the beach with a DJ and bar after dinner. Or you can rent the disco for private use from 9-11.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can rent a restaurant to have a completely private reception, which is what we did for our 73 guests. You have to have a minimum of 40 guests for restaurant rental. I think they have changed the pricing slightly from last year, but we paid a flat $800 for the rental of the restaurant which included the meal, beer and wine. We added the full bar per person per hour. The reception ended at 10pm. I did ask how much it would cost to extend it an hour, which I think was only a $200 fee for the staff, but when you add in the extra $190 per hour for the DJ and another hour of bar for everyone, it got to be a REALLY expensive hour!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You could also do the whole thing dinner and dancing on the beach, but if you have dinner on the beach they require you to rent a tent and that increases your costs pretty substantially.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps a little!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Hbinning, on 28 March 2016 - 04:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello brides! I'm getting married in 2017. Still trying to finalize a resort, I'm seriously considering Iberostar but would love some more info! Is the reception included in the package a private reception? If not, does anyone know how much extra it is for a private reception and how much it would be to extend the reception as well? Thank you!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.70.115","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1460647349,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64912525fd06e75237cdebb2178c0396","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is the Facebook group page all the ladies speak of everyone here is so helpful. &amp;nbsp;I would be lost without them! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"&gt;Iberostar&amp;nbsp;RoseHall-Sisterhood&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Traveling&amp;nbsp;Starfish! &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/125122217571235\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/125122217571235\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m also in search of the June 19th bride. &amp;nbsp;She&#039;s getting married the day before me. &amp;nbsp;I would like to know whether or not she&#039;s planning a bonfire the night of her wedding. &amp;nbsp;If she is then I can arrange another activity the night before my wedding after the welcome dinner... where is she LOL!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912855,"PostDate":1460647069,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is the Facebook group page all the ladies speak of everyone here is so helpful. \u00a0I would be lost without them! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Iberostar\u00a0RoseHall-Sisterhood\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0Traveling\u00a0Starfish! <\/span><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/125122217571235\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...25122217571235\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm also in search of the June 19th bride. \u00a0She's getting married the day before me. \u00a0I would like to know whether or not she's planning a bonfire the night of her wedding. \u00a0If she is then I can arrange another activity the night before my wedding after the welcome dinner... where is she LOL!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgirl@nyc.rr.com","IpAddress":"98.7.7.41","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1455678243,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286245.jpg?_r=1462081335","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"jgirlnyc","Id":286245,"Name":"jgirlnyc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.119.15.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1461011744,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a6f454b1e5a126ffaaef1ff18582313","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jgirlnyc\" post=\"1912855\" timestamp=\"1460643469\"]\nThis is the Facebook group page all the ladies speak of everyone here is so helpful.  I would be lost without them!  \n\n[color=rgb(20,24,35)][font=helvetica][size=3]Iberostar RoseHall-Sisterhood of the Traveling Starfish! [\/size][\/font][\/color][url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/125122217571235\/\"]https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/125122217571235\/[\/url]\n\nI&#039;m also in search of the June 19th bride.  She&#039;s getting married the day before me.  I would like to know whether or not she&#039;s planning a bonfire the night of her wedding.  If she is then I can arrange another activity the night before my wedding after the welcome dinner... where is she LOL![\/quote]\nthank you @[member=\"jgirlnyc\"] i have been looking all over for this group!","Attachments":[],"Id":1912935,"PostDate":1461011705,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jgirlnyc, on 14 April 2016 - 07:17 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>This is the Facebook group page all the ladies speak of everyone here is so helpful. \u00a0I would be lost without them! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Iberostar\u00a0RoseHall-Sisterhood\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0Traveling\u00a0Starfish! <\/span><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/125122217571235\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...25122217571235\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm also in search of the June 19th bride. \u00a0She's getting married the day before me. \u00a0I would like to know whether or not she's planning a bonfire the night of her wedding. \u00a0If she is then I can arrange another activity the night before my wedding after the welcome dinner... where is she LOL!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286245\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286245-jgirlnyc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jgirlnyc<\/span><\/a> i have been looking all over for this group!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cadesha.benson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.61.107.139","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453565902,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286018.jpg?_r=1459635518","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Endreece","Id":286018,"Name":"Endreece","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.30.181.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79887,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d6417069a772307f75ef87b90bc67f77","RawContent":"I&#039;m considering this venue for our wedding. I can&#039;t seem to contact the wedding coordinator it keeps giving me an error on the website. I&#039;m just confused with the a la carte because a lot of it is for 10 guests and we are having 20. Obviously I don&#039;t want to pay for 2 cakes etc","Attachments":[],"Id":1913216,"PostDate":1462066230,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm considering this venue for our wedding. I can't seem to contact the wedding coordinator it keeps giving me an error on the website. I'm just confused with the a la carte because a lot of it is for 10 guests and we are having 20. Obviously I don't want to pay for 2 cakes etc\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sweet.pea2018@mail.com","IpAddress":"65.30.181.228","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1461609047,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sweetpea2018","Id":286809,"Name":"Sweetpea2018","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
