206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137206220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57016ecf7949d04294bcd7d48ebc2b94","RawContent":"The &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.princesshotelsandresorts.com\/bavaro\/english\/weddings_and_honeymoon.html\"&gt;Bavaro Princess&lt;\/a&gt; is extraordinary in size, with over 96 acres of endless landscape, some of it tamed, some of it wild. Fanned -shaped palms, wandering peacocks flaunting their plumage, flowering trees, trails through mangroves, jungle with lagoons and natural springs, only begin to describe the abundance, of nature&#039;s beauty.\n \n The main pool is so large, that an aerial view at close range can hardly depict the swimmers! Islands within the pool flourish with towering bamboo and a shallow end which spills without an edge like a lagoon, is perfect for children. The big bonus is the beach. It is magnificent, with miles of white sand, graced by hundreds of coconut palms.\n \n All Inclusive 24 hours \n 2 large fresh water swimming pools (1 with swim-up bar) \n 6 Restaurants (Main Buffet, Argentinean Steakhouse, Italian, Seafood, Deluxe Buffet and Oriental) \n 1 Snack Bar \n 8 Bars (national and international drinks included) (2 bars with live music) \n Organized Daytime Activities \n Nightly Entertainment at the Princess Theatre \n Lancelot Disco Lounge (located at Tower Princess Casino) (entrance and national drinks included UP TO 2:30 am) \n Non-motorized water sports (free use) \n Bocce Ball, Archery, Volleyball, Beach Soccer, darts, ping-pong \n 3 Tennis Courts \/ mini soccer court \n Mini Zoo and ecological grounds with pathways for strolling and bird house \n Tower Princess Casino (free shuttle to and from Casino) \n Internal Transportation \n Fully equipped Fitness Centre, 2 Jacuzzis and 2 Sauna Rooms \n Mini-Club for children ages 5-12 years old (10:30 am-12:30pm &amp;amp; 3:00pm-5:00pm, located on the beach) \n Funtastic Teen&#039;s Club (ages 12-18, 4:00pm-11:00pm) \n Introductory Scuba Lesson in pool (1 lesson per person per stay) \n Honeymoon &#8220;Romance&#8221; Package (Complimentary Feature)","Attachments":[],"Id":103,"PostDate":1157949235,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The <a href='http:\/\/www.princesshotelsandresorts.com\/bavaro\/english\/weddings_and_honeymoon.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Bavaro Princess<\/a> is extraordinary in size, with over 96 acres of endless landscape, some of it tamed, some of it wild. Fanned -shaped palms, wandering peacocks flaunting their plumage, flowering trees, trails through mangroves, jungle with lagoons and natural springs, only begin to describe the abundance, of nature's beauty.<br \/> <br \/> The main pool is so large, that an aerial view at close range can hardly depict the swimmers! Islands within the pool flourish with towering bamboo and a shallow end which spills without an edge like a lagoon, is perfect for children. The big bonus is the beach. It is magnificent, with miles of white sand, graced by hundreds of coconut palms.<br \/> <br \/> All Inclusive 24 hours <br \/> 2 large fresh water swimming pools (1 with swim-up bar) <br \/> 6 Restaurants (Main Buffet, Argentinean Steakhouse, Italian, Seafood, Deluxe Buffet and Oriental) <br \/> 1 Snack Bar <br \/> 8 Bars (national and international drinks included) (2 bars with live music) <br \/> Organized Daytime Activities <br \/> Nightly Entertainment at the Princess Theatre <br \/> Lancelot Disco Lounge (located at Tower Princess Casino) (entrance and national drinks included UP TO 2:30 am) <br \/> Non-motorized water sports (free use) <br \/> Bocce Ball, Archery, Volleyball, Beach Soccer, darts, ping-pong <br \/> 3 Tennis Courts \/ mini soccer court <br \/> Mini Zoo and ecological grounds with pathways for strolling and bird house <br \/> Tower Princess Casino (free shuttle to and from Casino) <br \/> Internal Transportation <br \/> Fully equipped Fitness Centre, 2 Jacuzzis and 2 Sauna Rooms <br \/> Mini-Club for children ages 5-12 years old (10:30 am-12:30pm & 3:00pm-5:00pm, located on the beach) <br \/> Funtastic Teen's Club (ages 12-18, 4:00pm-11:00pm) <br \/> Introductory Scuba Lesson in pool (1 lesson per person per stay) <br \/> Honeymoon &#8220;Romance&#8221; Package (Complimentary Feature)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG'><strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137206220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName