"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.2.27","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af58848093593d47b8623d4b5d4e747d","RawContent":"Hi ladies,\n\n\nI know alot of us have been utilizing the 2014 Moon Palace thread. However, I thought it would be useful for us to have a thread for our needs since things change throughout the years. Plus this would be easier to navigate than going through 90 pages of threads. Palace changes preferred vendors at anytime apparently and has recently changed the promo for weddings.\n\n\n I am still trying to get the hang of the new promotion. I thought I understood it, then I was wrecking my brain last night trying to figure out what I needed to qualify for free nights. So stressful, I&#039;ve been having nightmares and my wedding isn&#039;t until June 2016.","Attachments":[],"Id":1875669,"PostDate":1413302918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies,<br><br>\nI know alot of us have been utilizing the 2014 Moon Palace thread. However, I thought it would be useful for us to have a thread for our needs since things change throughout the years. Plus this would be easier to navigate than going through 90 pages of threads. Palace changes preferred vendors at anytime apparently and has recently changed the promo for weddings.<br><br>\n I am still trying to get the hang of the new promotion. I thought I understood it, then I was wrecking my brain last night trying to figure out what I needed to qualify for free nights. So stressful, I've been having nightmares and my wedding isn't until June 2016.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 79 adult guests + bride and groom + 13 kids = 164 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20160617\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/7257\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401302870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c4318d134aac485f8f585d2abfd131c","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"TheBHolders\"], thanks for setting up this forum!\n\n\nWhich new promotion do they have? I&#039;m a Canadian bride and I think our promos are different. I&#039;m stressing out just getting the contract finalized! I&#039;ve had to correct the contract three times now. At least our weddings are still in 2016","Attachments":[],"Id":1875822,"PostDate":1413409950,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278146\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278146-thebholders\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TheBHolders<\/span><\/a>, thanks for setting up this forum!<br><br>\nWhich new promotion do they have? I'm a Canadian bride and I think our promos are different. I'm stressing out just getting the contract finalized! I've had to correct the contract three times now. At least our weddings are still in 2016\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410098585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.172.119.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b009a55ba646f8cc3d2f55dad577f804","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;For Canada (From Palace Website)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n\tFREE ROOMS, UPGRADES &amp;amp; PRIVATE FUNCTIONS.\n\n\tEARN UNLIMITED COMPLIMENTARY ROOMS FOR YOUR WEDDING:\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;Earn one complimentary room and one complimentary upgrade for every 10 paid rooms in your wedding group (unlimited)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n\tEARN FREE UNLIMITED EVENTS FOR YOUR WEDDING:\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;\"&gt;Book 75 room nights or more and get:&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n\u2022 All your private events included (one hour cocktail reception + two hour dinner. MAX three hours per day. Non cumulative)\n\n\u2022 MAX three hours per day. Non cumulative)\n&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;\"&gt;Book 60 - 74 room nights or more and get:&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n\u2022 1 Two hour private function\n&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;\"&gt;Book 30 - 59 room nights or more and get:&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n\u2022 1 Hour cocktail reception&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;For US (From Palace Website)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n\tFREE ROOMS, UPGRADES &amp;amp; PRIVATE FUNCTIONS.\n\n\tEARN UNLIMITED COMPLIMENTARY ROOMS FOR YOUR WEDDING AND NEXT TWO ANNIVERSARIES:\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;Earn one complimentary room and one complimentary upgrade for every 10 paid rooms in your wedding group (unlimited)\n\n\nPrefer to save your complimentary room for later? Get a Certificate for each room earned and come back to visit us within 24 months of your wedding date.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n\tEARN UNLIMITED COMPLIMENTARY EVENTS FOR YOUR WEDDING:\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;Book 75 room nights or more and get:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p  class=\"\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;\u2022 Free unlimited private functions (one hour cocktail reception + two hour dinner. MAX three hours per day. Non cumulative).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;Book 60 - 74 room nights or more and get:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p  class=\"\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;\u2022 1 Two hour private function&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;Book 30 - 59 room nights or more and get:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p  class=\"\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;\u2022 1 Hour cocktail reception&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;These concessions will be applicable for any new group bookings starting June 12, 2014, no cancellation and rebooking will be allowed, no exceptions&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69);\"&gt;Rooms cannot be used at Le Blanc. Rooms accrued at Le Blanc can be used at Le Blanc and any Palace Resort&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875841,"PostDate":1413421558,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">For Canada (From Palace Website)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\tFREE ROOMS, UPGRADES & PRIVATE FUNCTIONS.\n\n\tEARN UNLIMITED COMPLIMENTARY ROOMS FOR YOUR WEDDING:\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Earn one complimentary room and one complimentary upgrade for every 10 paid rooms in your wedding group (unlimited)<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\tEARN FREE UNLIMITED EVENTS FOR YOUR WEDDING:\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit\">Book 75 room nights or more and get:<\/span><br>\n\u2022 All your private events included (one hour cocktail reception + two hour dinner. MAX three hours per day. Non cumulative)<br>\n\u2022 MAX three hours per day. Non cumulative)<br><span  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit\">Book 60 - 74 room nights or more and get:<\/span><br>\n\u2022 1 Two hour private function<br><span  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit\">Book 30 - 59 room nights or more and get:<\/span><br>\n\u2022 1 Hour cocktail reception<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">For US (From Palace Website)<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\tFREE ROOMS, UPGRADES & PRIVATE FUNCTIONS.\n\n\tEARN UNLIMITED COMPLIMENTARY ROOMS FOR YOUR WEDDING AND NEXT TWO ANNIVERSARIES:\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Earn one complimentary room and one complimentary upgrade for every 10 paid rooms in your wedding group (unlimited)<br><br>\nPrefer to save your complimentary room for later? Get a Certificate for each room earned and come back to visit us within 24 months of your wedding date.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\tEARN UNLIMITED COMPLIMENTARY EVENTS FOR YOUR WEDDING:\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Book 75 room nights or more and get:<\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">\u2022 Free unlimited private functions (one hour cocktail reception + two hour dinner. MAX three hours per day. Non cumulative).<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Book 60 - 74 room nights or more and get:<\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">\u2022 1 Two hour private function<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Book 30 - 59 room nights or more and get:<\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">\u2022 1 Hour cocktail reception<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">These concessions will be applicable for any new group bookings starting June 12, 2014, no cancellation and rebooking will be allowed, no exceptions<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Rooms cannot be used at Le Blanc. Rooms accrued at Le Blanc can be used at Le Blanc and any Palace Resort<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 79 adult guests + bride and groom + 13 kids = 164 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20160617\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/7257\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401302870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a7c7678aeccf7be5d4d53289763efda","RawContent":"I&#039;ll ask my travel coordinator about this promo. Thanks so much!","Attachments":[],"Id":1875844,"PostDate":1413425142,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'll ask my travel coordinator about this promo. Thanks so much!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410098585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.205.216.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostK