             font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yea, 800 \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 79 adult guests + bride and groom + 13 kids = 164 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20160617\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/7257\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401302870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ea40f9f363b83f2a22631b6326e47f1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tbone12\" post=\"1876469\" timestamp=\"1413926263\"]\njust curious as to how much your wedding coordinator said the outside vendor fee was. Mine said it was $800, just want to make sure we are all being told the same thing.TIA[\/quote]\nMy contract states $400 for outside photography and $800 for all other outside vendors","Attachments":[],"Id":1876478,"PostDate":1413933027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tbone12, on 21 October 2014 - 01:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>just curious as to how much your wedding coordinator said the outside vendor fee was. Mine said it was $800, just want to make sure we are all being told the same thing.TIA<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nMy contract states $400 for outside photography and $800 for all other outside vendors\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410098585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.172.119.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abe83bd889cc63a01bb2e842053d3aab","RawContent":"Mine only says 800 for outside vendors. I was just gonna get day passes for my photographer","Attachments":[],"Id":1876490,"PostDate":1413942040,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Mine only says 800 for outside vendors. I was just gonna get day passes for my photographer\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 79 adult guests + bride and groom + 13 kids = 164 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20160617\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/7257\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401302870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.48.23.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e542456375ef4a0230af55ff4b0025e","RawContent":"I&#039;m just starting my planning at moon palace for my wedding next October. I didn&#039;t see anything in my contract for our date\/ time about an outside vendor fee, is this on another contract you got later? I&#039;m still waiting to hear back from the wedding coordinator to start actually planning the details. I&#039;m worried that everything is going to get more expensive than I originally planned!","Attachments":[],"Id":1877046,"PostDate":1414426614,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm just starting my planning at moon palace for my wedding next October. I didn't see anything in my contract for our date\/ time about an outside vendor fee, is this on another contract you got later? I'm still waiting to hear back from the wedding coordinator to start actually planning the details. I'm worried that everything is going to get more expensive than I originally planned! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"colleentf09@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.48.23.35","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1414426314,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"colleentf09","Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce1a5102cb95ae7a4e561f03c4399637","RawContent":"@[member=\"colleentf09\"] My contract was 5 pages long and the part about the outside vendor fees was under the fifth section of the contract entitled, \"Additional Costs\". This is where costs for things like private receptions and cocktail hours are outlined. Do you have this info? I hope this helps","Attachments":[],"Id":1877090,"PostDate":1414463228,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280885\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280885-colleentf09\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">colleentf09<\/span><\/a> My contract was 5 pages long and the part about the outside vendor fees was under the fifth section of the contract entitled, \"Additional Costs\". This is where costs for things like private receptions and cocktail hours are outlined. Do you have this info? I hope this helps\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410098585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78216","Title":"2015-2016 Moon Palace Brides","LastPostDate":1468270379},"Pages":{"TotalItems":120,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
